864
00:23:22,880 --> 00:23:24,000
That anxious feeling.

865
00:23:24,000 --> 00:23:24,360
Yeah.

866
00:23:25,760 --> 00:23:26,880
Looking forward to meeting.

867
00:23:27,160 --> 00:23:28,560
