877
00:23:49,040 --> 00:23:50,800
(Searching)

878
00:23:50,800 --> 00:23:52,480
It's been so many days.

879
00:23:53,220 --> 00:23:53,740
(Smiles)

880
00:23:53,760 --> 00:23:55,880
We haven't seen
each other for over a week.

881
00:23:55,880 --> 00:23:57,040
