890
00:24:07,450 --> 00:24:09,480
I almost went to wash my face.

891
00:24:10,880 --> 00:24:12,160
Why are your ears so red?

892
00:24:13,000 --> 00:24:14,120
You know I was really...

893
00:24:14,640 --> 00:24:16,440
