894
00:24:16,960 --> 00:24:19,320
It suddenly felt unfamiliar.

895
00:24:19,720 --> 00:24:21,280
Not unfamiliar with you.

896
00:24:21,280 --> 00:24:22,640
It's just meeting each other again

897
00:24:22,640 --> 00:24:23,680
