902
00:24:31,560 --> 00:24:32,920
I had such complicated feelings.

903
00:24:33,280 --> 00:24:34,520
Really complicated feelings.

904
00:24:35,240 --> 00:24:37,120
Because we had been exchanging letters.

905
00:24:37,120 --> 00:24:37,360
Yeah.

906
00:24:37,360 --> 00:24:39,000
It suddenly felt like he became real.

907
00:24:39,000 --> 00:24:39,760
I couldn't adjust.

908
00:24:39,760 --> 00:24:41,040
It had been so long since I saw her.

909
00:24:41,040 --> 00:24:41,840
And the two of us

910
00:24:41,840 --> 00:24:42,960
were pretty awkward then.

911
00:24:42,960 --> 00:24:43,880
A little nervous,

912
00:24:43,880 --> 00:24:44,640
but also really happy.

913
00:24:44,640 --> 00:24:45,600
It felt really wonderful.

914
00:24:47,240 --> 00:24:48,680
When he was holding his phone

915
00:24:48,680 --> 00:24:49,680
