916
00:24:49,680 --> 00:24:51,120
I was sitting beside him.

917
00:24:51,120 --> 00:24:53,360
It made me feel really safe.

918
00:24:54,840 --> 00:24:56,480
At that moment, I felt like

919
00:24:56,480 --> 00:24:57,320
I finally had someone

920
00:24:57,320 --> 00:24:58,560
