928
00:25:18,400 --> 00:25:19,230
Look at us.

929
00:25:19,230 --> 00:25:20,420
He actually said
what he was feeling inside.

930
00:25:20,420 --> 00:25:21,790
I'm really happy to see you.

931
00:25:21,880 --> 00:25:22,920
You were embarrassed seeing him.

932
00:25:23,480 --> 00:25:24,240
You were a little shy.

933
00:25:24,240 --> 00:25:25,280
I was really shy then.

934
00:25:27,210 --> 00:25:28,370
