935
00:25:29,550 --> 00:25:30,770
I'm extremely happy.

936
00:25:30,770 --> 00:25:31,810
I can't even put it into words.

937
00:25:31,810 --> 00:25:33,040
I'm extremely happy.

938
00:25:34,380 --> 00:25:35,370
I can tell.

939
00:25:35,680 --> 00:25:36,880
My ears are red too.

940
00:25:38,240 --> 00:25:39,720
I was really shy back then.

941
00:25:40,280 --> 00:25:41,320
It's been too long.

942
00:25:41,730 --> 00:25:42,910
Xing, don't worry.

943
00:25:43,510 --> 00:25:45,480
I'll take good care of Si for you.

944
00:25:45,730 --> 00:25:47,700
You wish you
could fly over there now, right?

945
00:25:47,700 --> 00:25:49,310
I want to fly there with you.

946
00:25:55,490 --> 00:25:56,540
These are the things

947
00:25:56,540 --> 00:25:57,710
I got yesterday.

948
00:25:57,710 --> 00:25:59,080
Whenever everyone went
to the stargazing room,

949
