But we didn't have one, right?

951
00:26:01,310 --> 00:26:02,680
So I bought two star lamps.

952
00:26:06,830 --> 00:26:07,500
It looks nice.

953
00:26:07,660 --> 00:26:08,320
Here's one for you.

954
00:26:08,500 --> 00:26:08,770
Okay.

955
00:26:09,100 --> 00:26:10,780
(Staring)

956
00:26:17,660 --> 00:26:18,710
Stop looking at me.

957
00:26:18,710 --> 00:26:20,620
(Shy)

958
00:26:20,910 --> 00:26:22,300
