You got a little emotional.

961
00:26:39,220 --> 00:26:40,180
(Sun Bohan's recorded moments
at Signal House)

962
00:26:40,180 --> 00:26:41,360
This was taken yesterday.

963
00:26:41,360 --> 00:26:42,760
