I don't think I've seen it before.

969
00:27:04,960 --> 00:27:06,080
I think you hid it.

970
00:27:06,080 --> 00:27:06,840
It's in my room.

971
00:27:08,640 --> 00:27:10,200
Because it was really hard back then.

972
00:27:11,560 --> 00:27:12,240
I couldn't eat,

973
00:27:12,240 --> 00:27:14,040
