979
00:27:21,120 --> 00:27:22,240
That way, when you came in,

980
00:27:22,240 --> 00:27:23,880
I could be...

981
00:27:24,360 --> 00:27:24,920
In your best state.

982
00:27:24,920 --> 00:27:25,480
