983
00:27:25,480 --> 00:27:25,800
Yeah.

984
00:27:27,650 --> 00:27:28,310
Give me your hand.

985
00:27:30,720 --> 00:27:31,590
Master Kong Jasmine Coins?

986
00:27:31,760 --> 00:27:32,780
I'm giving you
all my Master Kong Jasmine Coins.

987
00:27:32,900 --> 00:27:34,180
(Giving her
all his Master Kong Jasmine Coins)

988
00:27:34,180 --> 00:27:35,300
Oh my gosh.

989
00:27:35,550 --> 00:27:36,720
He gave her
all the Master Kong Jasmine Coins.

990
00:27:37,660 --> 00:27:41,100
(Trying not to laugh)

991
00:27:41,800 --> 00:27:43,160
I was really happy back then.

992
00:27:44,000 --> 00:27:45,600
It was such a happy day.

993
00:27:45,600 --> 00:27:46,720
But seeing it now,

994
00:27:46,720 --> 00:27:47,720
it still makes you a little sad,

995
00:27:47,720 --> 00:27:48,320
right?

996
00:27:48,320 --> 00:27:49,520
What matters is that it ended well.

997
00:27:49,880 --> 00:27:51,000
What matters is that it ended well.

998
00:27:55,560 --> 00:27:57,120
Do you feel confident about our life

999
00:27:57,120 --> 00:27:58,270
