1009
00:28:13,840 --> 00:28:14,640
Do you remember?

1010
00:28:14,960 --> 00:28:15,920
Who did that?

1011
00:28:15,920 --> 00:28:16,960
Si probably remembers.

1012
00:28:16,960 --> 00:28:18,000
I don't really remember either.

1013
00:28:18,000 --> 00:28:19,040
But I feel like

1014
00:28:19,040 --> 00:28:20,160
I wouldn't do something like that.

1015
00:28:20,370 --> 00:28:22,200
Someone purposely removed the table.

1016
00:28:23,360 --> 00:28:24,240
It definitely

1017
00:28:24,240 --> 00:28:24,880
helped.

1018
00:28:26,320 --> 00:28:27,360
It definitely worked.

1019
00:28:27,360 --> 00:28:29,080
Remove it so you get closer.

1020
00:28:29,080 --> 00:28:30,200
A little closer,

1021
00:28:30,200 --> 00:28:31,400
