1025
00:28:35,840 --> 00:28:37,280
His head was already almost...

1026
00:28:38,440 --> 00:28:40,440
Xing catches every little detail.

1027
00:28:41,320 --> 00:28:43,000
This is honestly pretty wild.

1028
00:28:44,820 --> 00:28:46,330
Do you feel confident

1029
00:28:46,680 --> 00:28:48,290
about our life after leaving

1030
00:28:48,290 --> 00:28:49,370
