1038
00:29:05,260 --> 00:29:05,820
(Laughs)

1039
00:29:05,840 --> 00:29:06,600
I support that.

1040
00:29:06,600 --> 00:29:07,880
I support
the high-speed rail being faster.

1041
00:29:09,680 --> 00:29:10,600
Because I might feel

1042
00:29:10,600 --> 00:29:11,640
