1050
00:29:20,920 --> 00:29:21,880
So I wanted to ask

1051
00:29:21,880 --> 00:29:23,160
what he thought.

1052
00:29:23,160 --> 00:29:24,720
Then I quickly thought about it.

1053
00:29:24,720 --> 00:29:25,600
I felt like maybe

1054
00:29:25,600 --> 00:29:26,720
