1058
00:29:33,440 --> 00:29:34,480
I was pretty satisfied then.

1059
00:29:34,580 --> 00:29:35,480
(Laughs)

1060
00:29:35,480 --> 00:29:37,280
Look, you were secretly smiling.

1061
00:29:40,060 --> 00:29:41,300
I'm ready.

1062
00:29:41,340 --> 00:29:43,180
(I'm ready)

1063
00:29:44,320 --> 00:29:45,880
That made you so happy.

1064
00:29:47,010 --> 00:29:49,600
I want to see more sides of you.

1065
00:29:52,720 --> 00:29:54,000
What were you ready for back then,

1066
00:29:54,000 --> 00:29:54,440
Cui Yihang?

1067
00:29:55,320 --> 00:29:57,880
Because in that environment,

1068
00:29:57,880 --> 00:29:59,280
I got to know Si better.

1069
00:29:59,280 --> 00:30:00,400
She might feel nervous

1070
00:30:00,400 --> 00:30:01,000
