be like together after the house.

1079
00:30:15,950 --> 00:30:16,860
Which hand should I wear it on?

1080
00:30:17,500 --> 00:30:18,070
Left hand.

1081
00:30:18,090 --> 00:30:19,580
(My right hand keeps scratching it)
This is the gift he gave me

1082
00:30:19,600 --> 00:30:21,360
(Okay)
during the heart-to-heart moment.

1083
00:30:21,360 --> 00:30:22,120
First time wearing it.

1084
00:30:22,120 --> 00:30:23,040
Yeah, the watch.

1085
00:30:23,040 --> 00:30:24,240
You didn't wear it last time
because it was raining.

1086
00:30:24,240 --> 00:30:24,920
Yeah.

1087
00:30:25,280 --> 00:30:26,880
I was just worried
it'd get ruined by the rain.

1088
00:30:26,880 --> 00:30:27,900
It fits perfectly.

1089
00:30:28,940 --> 00:30:29,840
That's amazing.

1090
00:30:30,880 --> 00:30:31,860
It really fits perfectly.

1091
00:30:33,120 --> 00:30:34,030
It really does.

1092
00:30:34,380 --> 00:30:35,380
(It fits perfectly)

1093
00:30:35,400 --> 00:30:36,660
So why does it fit perfectly?

1094
00:30:39,240 --> 00:30:39,880
When making the bracelet,

1095
00:30:39,880 --> 00:30:41,560
I could secretly

1096
00:30:41,560 --> 00:30:43,360
measure

1097
00:30:43,360 --> 00:30:45,280
your wrist size.

1098
00:30:47,400 --> 00:30:49,480
You really put thought into it.
You secretly remembered.

1099
00:30:55,240 --> 00:30:56,130
The sky is so blue.

1100
00:30:56,130 --> 00:30:56,840
Group outing day.

1101
00:30:56,850 --> 00:30:58,520
(Setting off)
You guys look so fresh.

1102
00:30:59,320 --> 00:31:00,480
(Holding hands)
Like the colors of the ocean.

1103
00:31:01,580 --> 00:31:02,300
Let's go.

1104
00:31:02,510 --> 00:31:04,260
Cao Yiheng is already carrying
the bag for her.

1105
00:31:04,350 --> 00:31:05,490
So thoughtful.

1106
00:31:06,900 --> 00:31:07,580
(Little bug)

1107
00:31:13,200 --> 00:31:14,280
You definitely did that on purpose.

1108
00:31:14,280 --> 00:31:14,760
No.

1109
00:31:14,760 --> 00:31:16,800
