1110
00:31:16,800 --> 00:31:17,880
My makeup almost came off.

1111
00:31:19,720 --> 00:31:20,600
No, but I have to swat it.

1112
00:31:20,600 --> 00:31:22,520
You could've blown it away like this.

1113
00:31:22,880 --> 00:31:24,040
Or just brushed it off.

1114
00:31:24,040 --> 00:31:25,320
I was afraid it'd be too intimate.

1115
00:31:26,120 --> 00:31:27,120
So I just...

1116
00:31:27,120 --> 00:31:28,520
You think that was better?

1117
00:31:29,960 --> 00:31:31,240
I thought it
was pretty annoying back then.

1118
00:31:32,000 --> 00:31:33,400
I wanted to punch him.

1119
00:31:33,400 --> 00:31:33,760
Look.

1120
00:31:33,760 --> 00:31:34,840
That mosquito was so obvious.

1121
00:31:36,770 --> 00:31:37,840
Coconut trees.

1122
00:31:37,880 --> 00:31:38,760
He's sitting in the middle too.

1123
00:31:38,760 --> 00:31:39,760
They learned from us.

1124
00:31:39,760 --> 00:31:40,340
Look at where these two are sitting.

1125
00:31:40,360 --> 00:31:41,140
Someone's in the middle.

1126
00:31:41,140 --> 00:31:41,990
They're sitting so close.

1127
00:31:44,240 --> 00:31:45,280
I was so sleepy.

1128
00:31:45,280 --> 00:31:46,080
I sat there too.

1129
00:31:47,320 --> 00:31:48,760
(Blocking the sunlight)
You just teased him for sitting there.

1130
00:31:48,760 --> 00:31:50,040
Now Cao Yiheng is sitting in the middle.

1131
00:31:50,040 --> 00:31:51,240
Did he think they entered a tunnel?

1132
00:31:51,240 --> 00:31:51,840
Entered a tunnel.

1133
00:31:54,480 --> 00:31:55,440
That's so funny.

1134
00:31:56,120 --> 00:31:57,200
Did you know that then?

1135
00:31:57,200 --> 00:31:57,920
I didn't know.

1136
00:31:58,680 --> 00:31:59,720
So thoughtful.

1137
00:31:59,720 --> 00:32:00,680
Because Cui Kaiyi was tired.

1138
00:32:01,280 --> 00:32:02,280
Cui Kaiyi was tired.

1139
00:32:02,280 --> 00:32:03,120
She needed to sleep.

1140
00:32:03,720 --> 00:32:04,840
She needed something to lean on.

1141
00:32:04,840 --> 00:32:06,240
So he had to sit in the middle.

1142
00:32:15,330 --> 00:32:16,220
Did everyone brake suddenly?

1143
00:32:17,600 --> 00:32:18,060
Are you okay?

1144
00:32:18,200 --> 00:32:19,490
No, it just happened so suddenly.

1145
00:32:21,480 --> 00:32:22,240
Look at that smile.

1146
00:32:23,640 --> 00:32:24,480
Look at that smile.

1147
00:32:26,480 --> 00:32:27,800
Even braking made him happy.

1148
00:32:32,180 --> 00:32:32,980
You're laughing at me.

1149
00:32:36,640 --> 00:32:37,220
No.

1150
00:32:38,600 --> 00:32:39,840
I've never laughed at you.

1151
00:32:40,720 --> 00:32:42,350
(I wasn't teasing you. You were cute)
Si was so cute then.

1152
00:32:42,350 --> 00:32:42,820
So...

1153
00:32:42,840 --> 00:32:44,280
(You're such a tiny girl)
I think you're cute too.

1154
00:32:44,410 --> 00:32:45,640
(but you're actually tall)
Really cute.

1155
00:32:45,820 --> 00:32:46,960
I think she's cute too.

1156
00:32:46,960 --> 00:32:47,670
Very what?

1157
00:32:48,160 --> 00:32:49,780
(Very what?)
What are you doing?

1158
00:32:49,780 --> 00:32:50,520
(Very tall)
You're holding hands.

1159
00:32:51,120 --> 00:32:52,520
No, I feel like

1160
00:32:52,520 --> 00:32:54,000
we've never held hands before.

1161
00:32:54,360 --> 00:32:55,480
What was that?

1162
00:32:55,480 --> 00:32:56,840
Was it all unconscious?

1163
00:32:56,840 --> 00:32:57,720
Ask him.

1164
00:32:58,880 --> 00:32:59,800
What was going on?

1165
00:33:00,680 --> 00:33:01,600
I don't know, I didn't...

1166
00:33:01,600 --> 00:33:03,200
Look, her hand
was already reaching toward mine.

1167
00:33:03,200 --> 00:33:04,200
But from your expression,

1168
00:33:04,200 --> 00:33:05,320
it was pretty obvious.

1169
00:33:05,320 --> 00:33:06,960
Was there
a little bit of intention behind it?

1170
00:33:09,680 --> 00:33:11,120
Let's keep watching.

1171
00:33:13,940 --> 00:33:15,220
Stop talking. Skip it.

1172
00:33:15,220 --> 00:33:16,420
That came out of nowhere.

1173
00:33:18,160 --> 00:33:19,200
He copied the way I talk.

1174
00:33:19,720 --> 00:33:21,600
This guy is a little too much.

1175
00:33:21,600 --> 00:33:22,760
So how would you rate this guy?

1176
00:33:22,760 --> 00:33:24,320
His performance in the car.

1177
00:33:25,480 --> 00:33:26,680
He was a little too much.

1178
00:33:27,720 --> 00:33:28,280
Definitely.

1179
00:33:30,200 --> 00:33:31,640
The car suddenly shook a little,

1180
00:33:31,640 --> 00:33:32,640
and then Si said,

1181
00:33:32,640 --> 00:33:33,600
"That was sudden."

1182
00:33:33,600 --> 00:33:34,280
And then...

1183
00:33:34,280 --> 00:33:35,160
Then he started laughing.

1184
00:33:35,160 --> 00:33:36,320
He started teasing me.

1185
00:33:36,840 --> 00:33:38,320
She was so soft and cute.

1186
00:33:38,600 --> 00:33:40,760
I couldn't help copying her a little.

1187
00:33:40,760 --> 00:33:42,960
Do you usually copy the way Si talks?

1188
00:33:42,960 --> 00:33:44,000
Only sometimes.

1189
00:33:44,000 --> 00:33:45,280
Only when she's especially cute.

1190
00:33:45,280 --> 00:33:45,720
I can't help it.

1191
00:33:45,720 --> 00:33:46,840
I really want to copy her.

1192
00:33:47,120 --> 00:33:48,680
She's so cute you can't resist, right?

1193
00:33:48,680 --> 00:33:50,040
The kind of cute that drives me crazy.

1194
00:33:51,520 --> 00:33:52,200
No.

1195
00:33:52,200 --> 00:33:53,120
It's just...

1196
00:33:54,000 --> 00:33:54,960
being crazed by cuteness.

1197
00:33:55,320 --> 00:33:55,880
No...

1198
00:33:56,640 --> 00:33:57,240
No...

1199
00:33:58,800 --> 00:34:00,120
No, I just wanted
to show her how she sounds.

1200
00:34:00,120 --> 00:34:01,360
No, there's no way to respond to that.

1201
00:34:01,360 --> 00:34:01,960
Everyone...

1202
00:34:02,640 --> 00:34:03,520
There's really no comeback.

1203
00:34:03,520 --> 00:34:04,320
It was so sudden.

1204
00:34:05,240 --> 00:34:06,800
It really was sudden.

1205
00:34:06,800 --> 00:34:08,080
It really was

1206
00:34:08,080 --> 00:34:09,040
from the heart.

1207
00:34:09,040 --> 00:34:10,040
I just wanted to punch you.

1208
00:34:11,699 --> 00:34:15,739
(Don't go anywhere. The next episode
is even more romantic.)
